        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. An eye examination including refraction performed in conjunction with a medical condition such as diabetes, glaucoma, and cataracts. (See Section 11.F for routine eye examination coverage.)",
            "block_bbox": [
                128,
                223,
