        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. Injectable legend drugs administered in a physician's office for covered conditions; medical devices (including contraceptive injections, devices, and implants) dispensed by a physician. Preventive injections or immunizations are not covered except as described in Section 11.C. Antigen, allergy serum, and insulin are not considered a physician's service; antigen, allergy serum, and insulin are covered under the preferred pharmacy card program; insulin also is covered under the mail service prescription drug program.",
