            "block_content": "No benefits are payable for therapy given at the therapist's discretion or elected by the covered person; any treatment for delayed development; therapy that is solely for the purpose of slowing body degeneration rather than restoring functional improvement; or therapy for custodial maintenance, self-help, recreational, or educational purposes.",
